    "title": "Santa Rita's Arbor Wood Cove lights up the season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Phoebe Johnson-Quaife Editorial Intern ,\n5 hours ago If you find yourself driving around to look at holiday lights, Santa Rita Ranch’s Arbor Wood Cove might just be the best place to go in Liberty Hill. “The Cove,” a nickname coined by neighbors, is a cul-de-sac in Santa Rita Ranch that truly decks the halls for the holidays. Through the work of three neighboring couples, the street is illuminated for all to enjoy. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
